  "body": "## What changed\n- split bot activity into active negotiations, negotiations started today, and next steps executed today for new vs older negotiations\n- expose `/api/bots/{botId}/activity/today` with day boundaries fixed to `Europe/Warsaw`\n- refresh daily activity and quota on the Bots page every 5 seconds instead of only on page load/manual refresh\n- rename the misleading `Dzisiejsze oferty` column to `Limit dzienny`\n- show confirmed, ambiguous and currently unattributed quota usage separately\n\n## Daily limit correctness\n- bind every new quota reservation to the persistent real-action guard `requestId`\n- retrying the same reservation is idempotent and cannot increment `/25` twice\n- releasing the same reservation twice is idempotent and cannot decrement `/25` twice\n- an audited `CONFIRMED` or `AMBIGUOUS` action cannot be released\n- rebuild/repair quota undercounts from the union of durable audit request IDs and active reservation request IDs, without double-counting request IDs present in both\n- keep conservative overcounts visible as `W toku / bez audytu` instead of silently lowering a safety limit\n- write quota reservation and real-action audit timestamps explicitly in `Europe/Warsaw`\n- add migration `V36__make_daily_offer_quota_idempotent.sql` for the request-id reservation ledger\n\n## Daily metrics\n- active negotiations: current `NEGOTIATING` rows\n- new negotiations today: distinct confirmed `FIRST_OFFER` actions since 00:00 Europe/Warsaw\n- next steps today: confirmed `NEXT_STEP` actions, split between negotiations started today and older negotiations\n- `/25`: conservative safety quota for all real offer actions (`FIRST_OFFER` + `NEXT_STEP`), not a count of new negotiations\n\n## Tests\n- configured quota limit\n- audit + reservation ledger union without duplicate request IDs\n- quota undercount repair\n- hard-limit refusal after reconciliation\n- idempotent reservation replay\n- idempotent repeated release\n- audited reservation cannot be released\n- release deactivates only its own unaudited reservation\n- daily activity split between negotiations started today and older negotiations",
